# DebugViz — Go

Layout:
- `go/cmd/debugviz/` — CLI (scan, instrument, wire)
- `go/lib/debugviz/` — runtime (Configure, StartSpan, HTTPMiddleware, interceptors)
- `go/pkg/scanner/adapters/` — EntryDiscoverer (chi, gin, echo, stdlib, grpc, cli)
- `go/pkg/codegen/instrument/` — inner spans
- `go/pkg/codegen/wire/` — entry hooks + Configure injection
- `go/pkg/protocol/` — graph + trace types (sync with schemas/)

Codegen rules:
- Idempotent re-runs; support `--dry-run`
- Golden file tests for scanner, instrument, wire
- MVP: instrument only `func(ctx context.Context, ...)` unless `allow_no_context: true`

Graph schema v2: node `entry_point` (kind http|grpc|cli|worker), edge `entry_handles`.
